  "decision_conditions": [
    "Occupier",
    "The development must be begun not later than the expiration of three years beginning with the date hereof.\r\rReason: To comply with Section 91 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990, as amended.",
    "All external facing materials, treatments and finishes shall be similar to those of the main dwelling building and maintained and retained thereafter. This applies unless differences are shown on the drawings we have approved. \r\rReason: To ensure that the extension harmonises with the existing building and to ensure compliance with Policy 28 of the Sutton Local Plan 2018.",
    "The development must be carried out in accordance with the provisions of the Fire Strategy (102 P04). \r\rReason: To ensure that the development incorporates the necessary fire safety measures in accordance with the Mayor's London Plan Policy D12.",
    "The outbuilding hereby permitted shall be used only for purposes incidental to the enjoyment of the dwellinghouse known as 36 Mulberry Mews and shall not be used as a separate primary self-contained unit of accommodation, or for any other purposes. \r\rReason: To ensure an acceptable standard of accommodation is provided and to ensure neighbouring amenity is protected in accordance with policies 9 and 29 of the Sutton Local Plan 2018."
